////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// 
//  #PSJ Utility calltips (161 API functions) 
//  #Base class: DItem
//  #Child classes: DFace, DBody, DEdge, DNode, DGroup, DElem, DCoord, DLoadBC, DConnect, DItemPair...
//  #List classes: DItemVector, BodyVector, NodeVector, ElemVector, 
//  FaceVector, EdgeVector, GroupVector, ConnectVector, CoordVector, LoadBCVector, DItemPairVector,... 
//  #Param types: DTableType, EntityType (DItemType), UnitType, 
//  ElemType, ElemKind, BoolType, PathType, AssociateType, ...
//  #Debugger: JPT.Debugger() ,JPT.PrintAppPathInfo(), print()
//  
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
@Base class: DItem 
@Description: class object for all of kind entity can cast to DFace, DBody, DEdge, DGroup, DNode, DElem, ...
@Properties:
isValid : check entity is valid or not : return bool
type : get type of entity : return EntityType 
typeID : get id of entity type : return int 
tableID : get id of entity table: return int 
id : get id of entity (external key) : return int 
name : get/set name of entity : return string 
targets : get targets of entity (use for group, pressure, force,...) : return DItemVector 
masters : get master targets of entity (use for RBE, MPC,...) : return DItemVector 
slaves : get slave targets of entity (use for RBE, MPC,...) : return DItemVector 
children : get childrens of entity (use for assembly tree): return DItemVector 
parent : get parent of entity (use for assembly tree): return DItemVector 
isHidden: check entity is show or hide in view
info : object information
@Example: 
listEntityObject = JPT.GetAllByTypeID(JPT.DItemType.BODY)
listEntityObject[0].isValid // read only
listEntityObject[0].type // read only
listEntityObject[0].typeID // read only
listEntityObject[0].name = "new name" // read/write
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DFace
@Description: class object for face entity can cast to DItem
@Properties:
typeID: get type of entity : return EntityType 
id: get id of entity (external key) : return int 
nodes: get list of node : return NodeVector 
elems: get list of element: return ElemVector
edges: get list of element: return EdgeVector
color: set/get color of face 
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DBody
@Description: class object for body entity can cast to DItem
@Properties: 
typeID: get type of entity : return EntityType 
id: get id of entity (external key) : return int 
name: get/set name of entity : return string 
faces: get list of face : return FaceVector 
elems: get list of element: return ElemVector
edges: get list of element: return EdgeVector
nodes: get list of node : return NodeVector  
vertex: get list of vertex : return DItemVector 
localMeshSettings: get list of local mesh settings : return DItemVector 
loadAndBCs: get list of LBCs : return LoadBCVector 
connections: get list of connections : return ConnectVector
contacts: get list of contacts : return DItemVector
properties: get list of properties : return DItemVector
materials: get list of materials : return DItemVector
mass: get mass value (double)
volume: get volume value (double)
gravityCenter: get gravity center (TVector3d)
momentInertia: get moment inertia (double list)
area: get area value (double)
references: get list of references : return DItemVector
color: set/get color of body 
colorMesh: set/get color of mesh line 
transparency: set/get transparency of body 
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DEdge
@Description: class object for edge entity can cast to DItem
@Properties: 
typeID: get type of entity : return EntityType 
id: get id of entity (external key) : return int 
edges: get list of element: return EdgeVector
nodes: get list of node : return NodeVector  
color: set/get color of edge 
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DElem
@Description: class object for element entity can cast to DItem
@Properties: 
typeID: get type of entity : return EntityType 
id: get id of entity (external key) : return int 
type: get element type : return int
kind: get element kind : return ElemKind
nodes: get list of node : return NodeVector  
color: set/get color of element  
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DGroup
@Description: class object for group entity can cast to DItem
@Properties: 
typeID: get type of entity : return EntityType 
id: get id of entity (external key) : return int 
name: get/set name of group : return string 
targets : get targets of group : return DItemVector 
color: set/get color of group 
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DNode
@Description: class object for node entity can cast to Entity
@Properties: 
isFloating: check node is floating node or not : : return bool
typeID: get type of entity : return EntityType 
id: get id of entity (external key) : return int 
pos: get x,y,z from node : return TVector3d
color: set/get color of node  
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DConnect
@Description: class object for connection entity can cast to Entity
@Properties: 
connectMethod: check node is floating node or not : : return bool
connectCoord: get related coordinate system of connection
color: set/get color of connection  
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DLoadBC
@Description: class object for Load Boundary Condition entity can cast to Entity
@Properties: 
lbcAnalysisType: get Load Boundary Condition type
lbcCoord: get related coordinate system of LBC
color: set/get color of Load Boundary Condition  
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DCoord
@Description: class object for coordinate entity can cast to Entity
@Properties: 
coordType: get coordinate system type
coordPoints: get position of 3 points coordinate system  
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: DItemPair
@Description: class object for pair of entities (element edge,...)
@Properties: 
firstDItem: get fisrt entity in pair entities (get fisrt node element edge)
secondDItem: get second entity in pair entities (get second node element edge)
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: VersionInfo
@Description: class object for version info file jtdb
@Properties: 
major : major jupiter version Ex: 4
minor : minor jupiter version Ex: 1
sub : sub jupiter version Ex: 4
build : release revision Ex: 47510
#==========================================================================================================
@Child classes: TVector3d
@Description: class object for vector3d use for node position, double list
@Properties: 
x
y
z
#==========================================================================================================
@List classes: DItemVector, BodyVector, FaceVector, ElemVector, GroupVector, NodeVector, EdgeVector, DItemPairVector,...
@Description: list of entity objects
@Methods: 
sizeVec() : return size of list
clearVec() : clear all list
addObj(entityObject) : append an entity to list
extendVec(listEntityObject) : insert another list entity to current list
deleteObj(1) : delete a entity in list by index
isContainObj(entityObject) : check if entityObject is exist in current list
#==========================================================================================================
Function: JPT.RemoveEntitiesByID
Description: remove entities from model by id
Input1: DItem type (JPT.DItemType)
Input2: id of entity (int)
Return: None
Example: 
listbody = JPT.GetEntitiesByName(JPT.DTableType.DTABLE_BODY, "Cube", JPT.BoolType.FALSE_VAL)
idbody = listbody[0].id
JPT.RemoveEntitiesByID(JPT.DItemType.BODY, idbody)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.RemoveEntitiesByName
Description: remove entities from model by name
Input1: DTable type (JPT.DTableType)
Input2: name of entity (string)
Input3: match with name option (1,0 or JPT.BoolType)
Return: None
Example: JPT.RemoveEntitiesByName(JPT.DTableType.DTABLE_BODY, "Cube_1", 1)
