Function: JPT.CreateSubAssembly
Description: Create a sub node under parent on assembly tree with name
Input1: name of sub node (string)
Input2: parent object (DItem class)
Return: new sub node object (DItem class)
Example: JPT.CreateSubAssembly("LocalSetting_1", parentObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.DeleteSubAssembly
Description: Delete a sub node from assembly tree
Input1: sub node object (DItem class)
Return: None
Example: JPT.DeleteSubAssembly(dentityObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.FindSubAssemblyByName
Description: Find a sub node from assembly tree by name
Input1: name of sub node (string)
Return: list DItem object matched with input name (DItemVector)
Example: JPT.FindSubAssemblyByName("LocalSetting_1")
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.FindSubAssemblyByID
Description: Find a sub node from assembly tree by id
Input1: id of entity sub node (int) 
Return: sub node object matched with input id (DItem) 
Example: JPT.FindSubAssemblyByID(1)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.DeleteSubAssemblyRecursively
Description: Delete a sub node and all childs from assembly tree
Input1: sub node object (DItem class)
Return: None
Example: JPT.DeleteSubAssemblyRecursively(dentityObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllPartsInSubAssembly
Description: get all parts in a sub node from assembly tree
Input1: sub node object (DItem class)
Return: list of DItem object matched with input name (DItemVector)
Example: JPT.GetAllPartsInSubAssembly(DItem) 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CastToDItem
Description: cast a child object to entity object
Input1: any kind of objects (Body, Face, Elem, Edge, Group, Node,...)
Return: entity object (DItem class)
Example: 
listDbodyObject = JPT.GetAllParts() 
bodyObject = listDbodyObject[0]
entityObject = JPT.CastToDItem(dbodyObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CastDItemToDBody
Description: cast a DItem object to Body object
Input1: DItem object (DItem class)
Return: Body object (Body class)
Example: 
listEntityObject = JPT.GetAllByTypeID(JPT.DItemType.BODY)
entityObject = listEntityObject[0]
bodyObject = JPT.CastDItemToDBody(dentityObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
