Function: JPT.ShowHideEntitiesByID
Description: show or hide an entity by id in view
Input1: DTable type (JPT.DTableType)
Input2: entity id (int)
Input3: show/hide option (1,0 or JPT.BoolType)
Return: None
Example: 
// hide a part
JPT.ShowHideEntitiesByID(JPT.DTableType.DTABLE_BODY, 1, JPT.BoolType.FALSE_VAL)
// show a part
JPT.ShowHideEntitiesByID(JPT.DTableType.DTABLE_BODY, 1, JPT.BoolType.TRUE_VAL)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.ShowHideAllParts
Description: show or hide all parts in view
Input1: show/hide option (1,0 or JPT.BoolType)
Return: None
Example: 
// show all parts
JPT.ShowHideAllParts(JPT.BoolType.TRUE_VAL)
// hide all parts
JPT.ShowHideAllParts(JPT.BoolType.FALSE_VAL)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.InverseHideBodies
Description: inverse hide parts in view
Input1: id of part (int)
Return: None
Example: 
listbody = JPT.GetEntitiesByName(JPT.DTableType.DTABLE_BODY, "Cube1", 1)
idbody = listbody[0].id
JPT.InverseHideBodies(idbody)
