--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewTranslation
Description: creating bodies preview for transform translation.
Input1: A list of bodies specifying the target for preview. This is a required input.
Input2: A list of double representing the Translation direction and value in X,Y,Z. This is a required input.
Input3: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input4: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Input5: A DCoord object specifying the local coordinate system. The default value is DCoord().
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
allParts = JPT.GetAllParts()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 255, 0)
if len(allParts):
   JPT.PreviewTranslation(allParts,[0.001,0.001,0.001],color,0.5,JPT.DCoord())
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewScaling
Description: creating bodies preview for transform scaling
Input1: A list of bodies specifying the target for preview. This is a required input.
Input2: A list of double representing the scale in X, Y, Z direction. This is a required input.
Input3: A list of double specifying the center coordinate. This is a required input.
Input4: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input5: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
allParts = JPT.GetAllParts()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 255, 0)
if len(allParts):
    JPT.PreviewScaling(allParts,[2,1.1,1.1],[0.005,0.005,0.005],color,0.5)
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewRotate
Description: creating bodies preview for transform rotation
Input1: A list of bodies specifying the target for preview. This is a required input.
Input2: A list of double specifying the rotation center. This is a required input.
Input3: A list of double specifying the axis vector. This is a required input.
Input4: A double specifying the rotation angle in degrees. This is a required input.
Input5: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input6: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Input7: A DCoord object specifying the local coordinate system. The default value is DCoord().
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
allParts = JPT.GetAllParts()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 255, 0)
if len(allParts):
    JPT.PreviewRotate(allParts,[0.005,0.005,0.005],[0,0,1],45,color,0.5,JPT.DCoord())
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewMirror
Description: creating bodies preview for transform mirror
Input1: A list of bodies specifying the target for preview. This is a required input.
Input2: A list of list of double specify the three points to define the plane. This is a required input.
Input3: A double specifying the offset value. The default value is 0.0.
Input4: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input5: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
allParts = JPT.GetAllParts()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 255, 0)
if len(allParts):
    JPT.PreviewMirror(allParts,[[0.0055,0.01,0.0055],[0.005,0.01,0.0044],[0.0044,0.01,0.0044]],0.0,color,0.5)
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewBCForceGeneral
Description: creating force preview by force and moment direction
Input1: A list of items(faces, edges, nodes) specifying the target for preview.  This is a required input.
Input2: A list of double specifying the force value in X,Y,Z direction.
Input3: A list of double specifying the moment value in RX,RY,RZ direction.
Input4: A int specifying arrow direction The default value is 0.
Input5: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input6: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Input7: A int specifying the arrow length value. The default value is 1.
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
AllSelected = JPT.GetAllSelected()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 0, 0)
if len(AllSelected):
    JPT.PreviewBCForceGeneral(AllSelected,[0.0,10.0,10.0],[0.0,0.0,0.0],0,color,0.5,1)
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewBCForceNormal
Description: creating force preview by normal direction of element
Input1: A DElem object specifying direction of arrow base on element normal. This is a required input.
Input2: A list of items(faces, edges, nodes) specifying the target for preview. This is a required input.
Input3: A int specifying arrow direction The default value is 0.
Input4: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input5: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Input6: A int specifying the arrow length value. The default value is 1.
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
AllSelected = JPT.GetAllSelected()
Elems = JPT.GetSelectedElems()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 0, 0)
if len(AllSelected) and len(Elems):
    JPT.PreviewBCForceNormal(Elems[0],AllSelected,1,color,0.5,1)
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.PreviewBCPressureGeneral
Description: creating pressure preview by surface normal direction
Input1: A list of items(faces, elements) specifying the target for preview.  This is a required input.
Input2: A int specifying arrow direction The default value is 0.
Input3: A int specifying the color in Jupiter. The default value is 255.
Input4: A double specifying the transparency value of bodies. The default value is 0.5.
Input5: A int specifying the arrow length value. The default value is 1.
Return: None
Example:
Geometry.Part.Cube()
AllSelected = JPT.GetAllSelected()
color = JPT.ConvertRGBToJPTColor(255, 255, 0)
if len(AllSelected):
    JPT.PreviewBCPressureGeneral(AllSelected,1,color,0.5,1)
JPT.ViewFitToModel()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetSuppressedParts
Description: Get a list of suppressed parts from assembly tree
Input: None
Return: list of DBody objects contain suppressed part information (BodyVector)
Example: JPT.GetSuppressedParts()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllSolverJobs
Description: get all solver jobs in current database
Input: None
Return: list of DSolverJob objects contain job information (SolverJobVector)
Example: JPT.GetAllSolverJobs() 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.DisableMessageBox
Description: disable message box dialog, it will print message with default pre-set option
Input: default option for message box (MsgBoxOptionType)
Return: None
Example: JPT.DisableMessageBox(JPT.MsgBoxOptionType.MB_OPTION_OK)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.EnableMessageBox
Description: enable message box after a DisableMessageBox() call
Input: None
Return: None
Example:
JPT.EnableMessageBox()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CastDItemToDRONode
Description: cast a DItem object to RO Node object
Input1: DItem object (DItem class)
Return: RO Node object (RO Node - Post Node class)
Example: 
listEntityObject = JPT.GetAllByTypeID(JPT.DItemType.POST_NODE)
entityObject = listEntityObject[0]
nodeObject = JPT.CastDItemToDRONode(entityObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CastDItemToDROElem
Description: cast a DItem object to RO Elem object
Input1: DItem object (DItem class)
Return: RO Elem object (RO Elem - Post Elem class)
Example: 
listEntityObject = JPT.GetAllByTypeID(JPT.DItemType.POST_ELEM)
entityObject = listEntityObject[0]
elemObject = JPT.CastDItemToDROElem(entityObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.ConvertCoordinateFromGlobalToLocal
Description: convert coordinate of entity from global to local coordinate system
Input1: DItem object (DItem class)
Input2: id of entity (int)
Input3: A DCoord object specifying the local coordinate system (DCoord class)
Return: A list of coordinates of nodes after conversion
Example: 
coord = JPT.GetAllCoordinates()
listCoords = JPT.ConvertCoordinateFromGlobalToLocal(JPT.DItemType.FACE, 26, coord[0])
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CloseAllGraphViews
Description: close all graph views of Post document(s)
Input1: None
Return: None
Example: JPT.CloseAllGraphViews()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CloseGraphViewByDocumentName
Description: close all graph view(s) of Post document by specifying document's name
Input1: document ID (string)
Return: None
Example: JPT.CloseGraphViewByDocumentName("nastran_solid_1")
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.HighlightByID
Description: highlight a property/lbc/contact targets on Main Window
Input1: DItem object (DItem class)
Input2: id of entity (int)
Input3: highlight or not (bool)
Return: None
Example: 
JPT.HighlightByID(JPT.DItemType.PROPERTY_3D_SOLID,1,True)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.EnableAllLicenses
Description: Enable or disable all licenses
Input1: Enable flag (bool)
Return: None
Example: 
JPT.EnableAllLicenses(False)
JPT.EnableAllLicenses(True)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllLicensesStatus
Description: Get all available licenses status
Input1: None
Return: A dictionary stores pairs of license name and its status
Example: 
pprint(JPT.GetAllLicensesStatus())
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllContacts
Description: Get information of all Contacts
Input: None
Return: list of DContact object (ContactVector)
Example: listContacts = JPT.GetAllContacts()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.CastDItemToDContact
Description: cast a DItem object to Contact object
Input1: DItem object (DItem class)
Return: Contact object (Contact class)
Example: 
listContactObjects = JPT.GetAllByTypeID(JPT.DItemType.CONTACT)
entityObject = listContactObjects[0]
contactObject = JPT.CastDItemToDContact(entityObject)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetScreenHeight
Description: get the height of screen window
Return: An integer specifying the height value
Example: 
height = JPT.GetScreenHeight()
print(height)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetScreenWidth
Description: get the width of screen window
Return: An integer specifying the width value
Example: 
width = JPT.GetScreenWidth()
print(width)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetScreenPositionOfEntities
Description: get screen position of entities
Input1: list of DItem objects (DItemVector)
Return: A list of integer standing for left, top, right, bottom
Example: 
listItem = JPT.GetAllByTypeID(JPT.DItemType.BODY)
print(JPT.GetScreenPositionOfEntities(listItem))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetResultTitle()
Description:  Get current result IDs (Process ID, Step ID, Result Name, Result Component) by PSJ command
Input: None
Return: Title Components by dictionary format
Example: ResultTitle = JPT.GetResultTitle()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllPostElems
Description: Get information of all Post elements
Input: None
Return: list of DROElem objects contain element information (PostElemVector)
Example: JPT.GetAllPostElems()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllPostNodes
Description: Get information of all Post nodes
Input: None
Return: list of DRONode objects contain node information (PostNodeVector)
Example: JPT.GetAllPostNodes()
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetResultByNodeId
Description: Get the result value of specified Node by ID
Input: An Integer specifying the ID of Node to be checked the result value. This is a required input.
Return: A Double specifying the result of Node
Example: JPT.GetResultByNodeId(62)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetResultByElemId
Description: Get the result value of specified Element by ID
Input: An Integer specifying the ID of Element to be checked the result value. This is a required input.
Return: A Double specifying the result of Element
Example: JPT.GetResultByElemId(658)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllResultsByNodeId
Description: Get all the result values of specified Node by ID
Input1: An Integer specifying the ID of Node to be get the result values. This is a required input.
Input2: A Boolean specifying the option to express the blank value. The default value is False.
Return: A List specifying all results of Node
Example: JPT.GetAllResultsByNodeId(62)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function: JPT.GetAllResultsByElemId
Description: Get all the result values of specified Element by ID
Input1: An Integer specifying the ID of Element to be get the result values. This is a required input.
Input2: A Boolean specifying the option to express the blank value. The default value is False.
Return: A List specifying all results of Element
Example: JPT.GetAllResultsByElemId(658)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------